n\":\"N001 already exports the calculus identities reused by R003 and R005; N002 already exports the support, integrability and uniform-bound facts reused by R003, R004 and R005. Their applications are not duplicated derivations. Remaining overlaps, such as M007 product-rule applications in R001/R004 and M004 mean-value applications in R003/R005, use different functions and conclusions; extracting generic wrappers would add producer and cut-review overhead without an identified substantial repeated local derivation. Moreover, inventory.json lists every existing consumer R001–R005 as having accepted background notes, excluding all of them from this narrow delta route. Thus no eligible extraction can replace work in two consumers. Leave the accepted graph and all local derivations unchanged; no measured speedup is asserted.\"}}","status":"completed"}],"error":null,"incomplete_details":null,"tools":[{"type":"function","name":"read_task_input","description":"Read one declared frozen document. For JSON use pointer (empty string lists the root); large objects return keys, and strings resume with offset=next_offset. For text use inclusive start/end lines and column=next_column when continuing a long line. Every serialized result is at most 32 KiB. Follow has_more and the returned continuation coordinates; no arbitrary local files are accessible.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"start":{"type":"integer"},"end":{"type":"integer"},"column":{"type":"integer"},"pointer":{"type":"string"},"offset":{"type":"integer"},"limit":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["id"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_yui","description":"Read declared Yui rules/templates; no tests, historical runs or personal files.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"start":{"type":"integer"},"end":{"type":"integer"},"column":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["path","start","end"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"check_artifact","description":"Check a JSON artifact against the explicit stage contract; this is not automatic mathematical certification.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"artifact_json":{"type":"string"}},"required":["artifact_json"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"submit_artifact","description":"Submit a JSON artifact after its stage checks.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"artifact_json":{"type":"string"}},"required":["artifact_json"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"report_obstacle","description":"Report an actual obstacle using these five direct fields. Countercheck the alleged implication against the complete definitions, quantifiers and inequality directions; a feasible example alone does not determine an extremum. A fact not yet proved or registered in the current draft is an obligation to complete, not by itself a gap. For a mathematical stop, identify the concrete implication and actual mathematical difficulty encountered during normal checking/completion, not merely unfilled inventory or exposition. No fixed time/attempt count or counterexample is required. SUBSTANTIVE_GAP/SUSPECTED_GAP stop for an actual supported mathematical obstruction; INPUT_CONFLICT stops for incompatible inputs. In NL0, use source retrieval and explicit conditional deferral for unavailable primary texts; MISSING_SOURCE_STATEMENT requires that no complete secondary statement can be obtained. Other stages may report SOURCE_UNAVAILABLE for an actual access obstacle. Ordinary unfinished work is not an obstacle report. No mathematical acceptance is generated.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"status":{"type":"string","enum":["SUBSTANTIVE_GAP","SUSPECTED_GAP","SOURCE_UNAVAILABLE","MISSING_SOURCE_STATEMENT","INPUT_CONFLICT"]},"location":{"type":"string"},"explanation":{"type":"string"},"basis":{"type":"string"},"partial_progress":{"type":"string"}},"required":["status","location","explanation","basis","partial_progress"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"check_draft","description":"Preferred structured-object form of check_artifact: provide artifact as an actual JSON object, not an escaped JSON string. Same complete validation and acceptance scope.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"artifact":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":true}},"required":["artifact"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"submit_draft","description":"Preferred structured-object form of submit_artifact: provide artifact as an actual JSON object, not an escaped JSON string. Same complete validation and acceptance scope.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"artifact":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":true}},"required":["artifact"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false}],"tool_choice":"auto","parallel_tool_calls":false,"prompt_cache_key":"aadb0ed3-ec9d-4cc5-9e9d-39d706aa09b7","prompt_cache_retention":"24h","text":{"format":{"type":"text"},"verbosity":"low"},"top_p":0.98,"top_logprobs":0,"temperature":1.0,"reasoning":{"effort":"high","context":"all_turns","summary":null,"mode":"standard"},"user":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":23665,"input_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0},"output_tokens":254,"output_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":70},"total_tokens":23919,"attribution":{"items":{"fc_001af12dcaa1d1fb016ae215d9f7ec8191b403385b28620d16":{"input_tokens":26,"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"fc_001af12dcaa1d1fb016ae215de34d88191be2b415d73359318":{"input_tokens":31,"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"fc_001af12dcaa1d1fb016ae215e148448191aba9b9f0ed4ec87b":{"input_tokens":37,"cached_tokens":0,"c